    "long_instructions": "##Create an Decision-Making Chatbot\r\n\r\n**1. Create the System Prompt:** customize your chatbot by adding the following information into the system prompt dialog box-\r\n- Give the chatbot a role and a task\r\n- Explain which traits / characteristics are most important to consider and those that are less important\r\n\r\n**2. Attach Resources:** Click [_Add File_] and then [_From Library_], selecting the file that contains information about the candidates that you reviewed.\r\n\r\n**3. Test your chatbot:** See if it aligns with your values, and if not, refine the system prompt accordingly.",
